                 "Provoking", "IronBased", "NonMil"
-roles         = "Ferryboat", "FerryStartUnit"
+roles         = "Ferryboat", "FerryStartUnit", "BarbarianBoat"
 helptext      = _("\
 The Trireme is your first boat unit. It can act\
